    "detailed_description": "<h1>Spiritual Sequel Coming Soon</h1><p><strong>Hero Team</strong> is the new spiritual sequel to Stick 'Em Up 2, with the same classic side-scrolling shooter gameplay, but now with full 4v4 online play, deep loadout customization, and modern presentation:<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/282780/extras/2851ba179447547313b318cd90803722.poster.avif?t=1656356062\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/282780/extras/2851ba179447547313b318cd90803722.webm?t=1656356062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/282780/extras/2851ba179447547313b318cd90803722.mp4?t=1656356062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>It's releasing this fall, so head over to its Steam page to learn more and add it to your wishlist now.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>Stick 'Em Up 2: Paper Adventures</strong> is a run'n'gun/platform game of stick figure characters fighting through beautiful paper and card levels.<br><br>Fly across city rooftops firing rockets from a helicopter, leap between pirate ships with a sword, race buggies on the moon, and more!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play with between 1 and 4 players with extra controllers or by connecting over your local network<br></li><li>Play together in campaign mode, or fight against each other in VS and Team VS modes</li></ul><br>Don't have enough controllers for 4 people? Your friends can join your network game for free using <strong>Stick 'Em Up 2: Starter Edition</strong>, available for computers, smartphones, and tablets!",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Stick 'Em Up 2: Paper Adventures</strong> is a run'n'gun/platform game of stick figure characters fighting through beautiful paper and card levels.<br><br>Fly across city rooftops firing rockets from a helicopter, leap between pirate ships with a sword, race buggies on the moon, and more!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play with between 1 and 4 players with extra controllers or by connecting over your local network<br></li><li>Play together in campaign mode, or fight against each other in VS and Team VS modes</li></ul><br>Don't have enough controllers for 4 people? Your friends can join your network game for free using <strong>Stick 'Em Up 2: Starter Edition</strong>, available for computers, smartphones, and tablets!",
